---
description: Expo Go previews must target the SDK installed on the phone
alwaysApply: true
---

The phone used to preview SameWave has App Store / Play Store Expo Go for **SDK 58**.

- Keep `artifacts/same-same` on Expo SDK 58. Do not downgrade it, and do not ask for an older Expo Go.
- Confirm the dev-server manifest reports SDK 58 before sharing a preview link.
- Use `expo-audio` for playback and recording. `expo-av` is not bundled in SDK 58 Expo Go.
- Serve Expo Go previews on an `*.exp.direct` hostname. Expo Go opens `exp://` as plain HTTP, so a trycloudflare link will not load.
